@startuml epic-f-event-flow
!theme plain
title Epic F: 選手分析（長期表現追蹤）- Event Flow

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<command>> LightBlue
  BackgroundColor<<query>> LightCyan
  BackgroundColor<<event>> LightYellow
}

actor "教練/分析使用者" as User

' === Player Records ===
rectangle "查詢選手紀錄" <<query>> as QRY_F001
rectangle "批次刪除選手紀錄" <<command>> as CMD_F001

rectangle "PlayerRecordListQueried\n選手紀錄列表已查詢" <<event>> as EVT_F001
rectangle "PlayerRecordsBatchDeleted\n選手紀錄已批次刪除" <<event>> as EVT_F002

' === Player Stats ===
rectangle "查看選手統計" <<query>> as QRY_F002
rectangle "PlayerStatsDisplayed\n選手統計已顯示" <<event>> as EVT_F003

' 連線
User --> QRY_F001
QRY_F001 --> EVT_F001

User --> CMD_F001
CMD_F001 --> EVT_F002

User --> QRY_F002
QRY_F002 --> EVT_F003

note right of EVT_F001
  支援關鍵字搜尋
  依球隊篩選
end note

note right of EVT_F003
  包含：
  - 月平均統計
  - 熱區圖
end note

@enduml
